<td data-start="4292" data-end="4328" data-col-size="sm">Packs with inserts and enclosures</td>
<td data-start="4328" data-end="4359" data-col-size="sm">Marketing kits, launch packs</td>
<td data-start="4359" data-end="4384" data-col-size="sm">Balanced fold strength</td>
<td data-start="4384" data-end="4413" data-col-size="md">Sort inserts before loading</td>
</tr>
