<td>Simple swap-out when offers change or new themes go live</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Counters and queue areas</td>
<td>Compact Tabletop Cardboard Display Stands</td>
<td>Travel-size items, mints, small gadgets</td>
<td>Quick-grab items stay visible near payment touchpoints</td>
<td>Easy movement for staff when reconfiguring till layouts</td>
</tr>
<tr>
